Subject: [PATCH 0/2] Add Arm CCA RA-TLS attestation and samples

This series adds the CCA attester and verifier, integrates CCA evidence into
the OpenSSL RA-TLS certificate flow, and adds CCA client/server samples with
measurement-log and baseline validation helpers.

Apply this series on top of:

  40f7b78403d75d13b1a372c769b2600f62b02692
  samples: Clean up banner info

The first patch contains the attester/verifier and certificate integration.
The second adds the CCA command-line samples, baseline helpers and packaging
metadata.

ryk (2):
  cca verifier and attester
  cca verifier and attester cli command

